A NOTE ON THE FINITE-ELEMENT EXPORTS
------------------------------------
reference/ANSYS_750W/ contains numerical results exported from a model
built by the authors in ANSYS Maxwell. The exported numbers are the
authors' own data. The solver itself is not redistributed, and no ANSYS
project file, mesh or licence is included.
